  "content": "Last updated: 2025-03-08 (JP)\n\nPurpose\n- Single table of provisioning runs with per-stage timestamps and outcomes.\n- Used for p50/p95 \u201ctime-to-ready\u201d and for identifying regressions by region/SKU/stage.\n- Source of truth is provisioning events (stage.start/stage.finish/stage.fail) emitted by fleet-provisioner + control plane.\n\nNotes / conventions\n- All timestamps UTC.\n- \u201cTotal TTR\u201d is ReadyAt - RequestedAt.\n- Durations are in minutes and rounded to nearest whole minute for quick scan.\n- Stage model (ENG-2742): Requested \u2192 Provisioning \u2192 Imaging \u2192 Bootstrapping \u2192 Validating \u2192 Ready/Failed.\n- If a stage is retried, we record the first start and the final finish; retry count captured separately.\n- If Ready was erroneously set early (race fixed in PR-48245), mark anomaly=EARLY_READY_SET and keep both timestamps.\n- Pool types:\n  - NEW_POOL: new Dedicated pool created\n  - EXPANSION: add nodes/GPUs to existing pool\n\nColumn dictionary\n- run_id: internal provisioning run id (same as correlation_id in structured events)\n- pool_id: Dedicated pool identifier\n- customer: internal-friendly alias; \u201cINTERNAL\u201d for test pools\n- env: staging|prod\n- region: us-east-1|us-west-2|eu-central-1\n- sku: e.g., a100-80gb|h100-80gb|l40s-48gb\n- pool_type: NEW_POOL|EXPANSION\n- nodes: count of nodes targeted by the run\n- feature_flag: provisioning_v2 on/off\n- requested_at: time run created\n- prov_start/prov_end: infra provisioning (Terraform apply + cloud readiness)\n- img_start/img_end: imaging + base config (golden image, drivers, node prep)\n- boot_start/boot_end: cluster bootstrap + helm installs + registration\n- val_start/val_end: readiness suite (gpu health/net/dns/tls/runtime smoke) + perf-canary (if enabled)\n- ready_at: control plane marks Ready (routing can consume)\n- outcome: READY|FAILED|CANCELLED\n- fail_stage/fail_reason: only if FAILED/CANCELLED\n- retries: total retries across stages (best-effort)\n- anomaly: EARLY_READY_SET|MISSING_STAGE_EVENT|\u2014\n\n\nTABLE (CSV-style)\nrun_id,pool_id,customer,env,region,sku,pool_type,nodes,feature_flag,requested_at,prov_start,prov_end,img_start,img_end,boot_start,boot_end,val_start,val_end,ready_at,total_ttr_min,prov_min,img_min,boot_min,val_min,outcome,fail_stage,fail_reason,retries,anomaly\nprun_20250212_001,pool-int-stg-a,INTERNAL,staging,us-west-2,l40s-48gb,NEW_POOL,8,on,2025-02-12T18:04:12Z,2025-02-12T18:06:01Z,2025-02-12T18:39:18Z,2025-02-12T18:41:02Z,2025-02-12T19:22:40Z,2025-02-12T19:24:11Z,2025-02-12T20:03:05Z,2025-02-12T20:05:22Z,2025-02-12T20:29:58Z,2025-02-12T20:31:10Z,147,33,42,39,25,READY,,,0,\u2014\nprun_20250213_002,pool-int-stg-a,INTERNAL,staging,us-west-2,l40s-48gb,EXPANSION,4,on,2025-02-13T17:12:33Z,2025-02-13T17:13:10Z,2025-02-13T17:31:45Z,2025-02-13T17:33:02Z,2025-02-13T17:58:29Z,2025-02-13T18:00:06Z,2025-02-13T18:22:19Z,2025-02-13T18:23:11Z,2025-02-13T18:38:20Z,2025-02-13T18:39:02Z,86,19,25,22,15,READY,,,0,\u2014\nprun_20250214_003,pool-int-stg-b,INTERNAL,staging,us-east-1,a100-80gb,NEW_POOL,16,on,2025-02-14T16:40:09Z,2025-02-14T16:41:20Z,2025-02-14T17:36:02Z,2025-02-14T17:38:11Z,2025-02-14T19:05:44Z,2025-02-14T19:08:03Z,2025-02-14T20:11:52Z,2025-02-14T20:14:33Z,2025-02-14T20:51:17Z,2025-02-14T20:52:40Z,253,55,88,64,38,READY,,,1,\u2014\nprun_20250215_004,pool-int-stg-b,INTERNAL,staging,us-east-1,a100-80gb,EXPANSION,8,on,2025-02-15T15:03:52Z,2025-02-15T15:04:40Z,2025-02-15T15:34:18Z,2025-02-15T15:35:09Z,2025-02-15T16:22:55Z,2025-02-15T16:24:01Z,2025-02-15T16:57:43Z,2025-02-15T16:59:10Z,2025-02-15T17:21:33Z,2025-02-15T17:22:00Z,138,30,48,34,22,READY,,,0,\u2014\nprun_20250216_005,pool-int-stg-c,INTERNAL,staging,eu-central-1,h100-80gb,NEW_POOL,8,on,2025-02-16T11:22:05Z,2025-02-16T11:25:11Z,2025-02-16T12:31:44Z,2025-02-16T12:34:22Z,2025-02-16T14:58:03Z,2025-02-16T15:02:10Z,2025-02-16T16:10:18Z,2025-02-16T16:12:09Z,2025-02-16T16:55:40Z,2025-02-16T16:57:12Z,335,67,144,68,45,READY,,,2,\u2014\