oss-region artifact fetches.\n- eu-central-1 h100 NEW_POOL has highest bootstrapping time due to additional compliance helm charts + slower node readiness.\n- A couple of \u201cEARLY_READY_SET\u201d anomalies around 2025-03-02; fixed by PR-48245 (transactional check to block Ready until perf-canary done).\n- Failures seen so far:\n  - ImagingTimeout (artifact mirror selection)\n  - GPUHealth ECC threshold (should auto-replace node; see eng-infra Slack 1709566000)\n  - Bootstrapping helm values mismatch (pilot incident; see incidents thread 1709135111)\n\nTODO (sheet hygiene)\n- Add columns for: perf_canary_enabled (yes/no), golden_image_version, runtime_chart_version.\n- Add computed flags: stage_budget_breached_{prov,img,boot,val}, total_budget_breached.\n- Backfill older runs (Jan 2025) from logs once Logan finishes backfill job (ENG-2756).\n- Normalize customer aliases to match dashboard variable templates (INT-1045).\n",
